2026-10-17 | Home page (hero + layout)
- Added src/app/components/home/ (home.ts, home.html, home.scss, home.spec.ts): hero with title, text, "New survey" button, illustration; placeholder "Your surveys" section.
- app.routes.ts: added route '' -> Home.
- app.html / app.ts: removed <app-highlight-cards> and its import (to be used inside Home later); router-outlet now sits between header and footer.
- styles.scss: added color variables and body base styles.

2026-10-21 | Navigation New survey -> Create survey
- app.routes.ts: added route 'create-survey' -> CreateSurvey.
- home.ts: injected Router, added goToCreateSurvey().
- home.html: replaced empty (click) on img with (click)="goToCreateSurvey()" on the button.

2026-10-21 | Create survey page design
- create-survey.html: replaced placeholder with static layout (header, panel, question block, publish) based on docs/Poll App Design.
- create-survey.scss: added BEM styles, mobile first, centered card from 769px.

2026-10-21 | Create survey desktop layout
- create-survey.html: restructured (head grid, details/questions grids, trash inside field, Cancel button text, publish check span) per docs/Poll App Design/Create Survey*.png.
- create-survey.scss: desktop grid layout from 769px, category select styled as plain text with arrow; mobile layout kept.

2026-10-21 | Results component design
- results.html: replaced placeholder with static "Survey results LIVE" layout (4 questions, answer rows with letter, bar, percent) based on docs/Poll App Design/Single survey view + results.jpg. Hardcoded values, no functions yet.
- results.scss: added BEM styles (bars, orange fill, mobile first, desktop adjustments from 769px).

2026-10-21 | Create survey: dynamic questions/answers + Supabase save
- supabase-service.ts: added SurveyInput/QuestionInput interfaces and createSurvey() (inserts surveys -> questions -> answers; deletes the survey again if a later insert fails).
- create-survey.ts: replaced single FormControl with reactive form (title, category, endDate, description, questions FormArray with answers FormArray); added addQuestion/removeQuestion/addAnswer/removeAnswer/publish.
- create-survey.html: bound form controls, @for over questions/answers, click handlers, error message, publish disabled while saving.
- create-survey.scss: added __answer-list and __error.
- Requires Supabase tables surveys, questions (+ allow_multiple), answers with group_id foreign keys and anon RLS policies.

2026-10-21 | Supabase schema update (groups + user_id)
- supabase-service.ts: table 'surveys' renamed to 'groups' (insert and cleanup delete); added getUserId() with anonymous sign-in fallback; groups insert now sends user_id.
- Requires groups.title, questions.allow_multiple, anonymous sign-ins enabled and matching RLS policies in Supabase.

2026-10-22 | Create survey: Cancel button
- create-survey.ts: goToHome() now navigates to absolute route "/" (was [""]); moved method below the form definition and fixed indentation.

2026-10-22 | Mobile view for new survey button
- _buttons.scss: hover animation only under @media (hover: hover); on <=768px / touch the icon is always visible, smaller font and padding.
- home.scss: mobile order now targets .btn inside .home__hero (old .home__hero--button class no longer exists, button was rendered above the title).

2026-10-22 | Create survey: show real save error
- create-survey.ts: publish() catch now logs the error with console.error and appends the Supabase error message to errorMessage (diagnosis for failing upload).

2026-10-22 | Create survey: feedback for invalid form
- create-survey.ts: publish() now sets errorMessage when the form is invalid (title, question and answer fields are required) instead of returning silently.

2026-10-22 | Fix Supabase URL
- environments/environment.ts and environment.development.ts: supabaseUrl had a trailing /rest/v1/; createClient needs the plain project URL, so auth and table requests went to wrong paths.
